      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Sammichike/status/2004078565013307509",
      "text": "Merry Christmas, everyone! 🎄\n\nA little founder reflection on SnapVid this Christmas morning:\n\nStarted this as a simple tool to fix my own frustration with video sharing in Nigeria.\n\nNow? Traffic from 77 countries in the last week.\n\nHighlights:\n\n• Nigeria: 65% click-through rate — people see it, they click immediately\n\n• Indonesia: 459 impressions in one day\n\n• Pakistan, Vietnam, India, Philippines — all discovering it organically\n\nNo ads. No marketing budget.\n\nJust one WhatsApp share → group → country → continent.\n\nThis is what happens when you build something people actually need.\n\nGrateful for every creator trying SnapVid this year.\n\nIf you're sharing videos (sermons, skits, demos, courses), \n\nGive it a try: https://t.co/I5Ib1QLExp\n\n#buildinpublic #MadeInNigeria #AfricanTech #StartupJourney",
